---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import '../styles/global.css';
import site from '../../site.json';
import Socials from '../components/Socials.astro';
import Avatar from '../components/Avatar.astro';
import { MapPinHouse } from '@lucide/astro';
import { Plus } from '@lucide/astro';

const pageTitle = "Home";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
	<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 font-semibold text-center mt-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center md:gap-8  md:text-left">
		<Avatar />
		<div>
			<h2>{site.name}</h2>
			<h2>{site.role}</h2>
			<a href="">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 justify-center md:justify-start">
					<MapPinHouse class="w-6 h-6"/>
					<h2>{site.location}</h2>
				</div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<Socials />
	
	<div>
		<p>
			Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec ac nibh eros. Nam id nulla ac libero ornare luctus a at neque. 
			<button type="button" class="toggleBtn btn btn-xs cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-zinc-700 px-1 py-[0.5] text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-50 hover:opacity-100 relative -top-[2px] ml-1.5 opacity-80">
				<Plus class="w-4 h-4"/>
			</button>
			<span class="hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 text-info">
				Curabitur faucibus velit sit amet tellus placerat, ut iaculis velit scelerisque. Donec placerat metus vel luctus faucibus.
				<button type="button" class="toggleBtn btn btn-xs cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-zinc-700 px-1 py-[0.5] text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-50 hover:opacity-100 relative -top-[2px] ml-1.5 opacity-80">
				<Plus class="w-4 h-4"/>
				</button>
				<span class="hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 text-info">
					Phasellus nulla mi, pellentesque nec lobortis at, ornare eget velit. Etiam porta tortor risus, quis mattis metus semper nec.
				</span>
			</span>
			Phasellus ac lorem nec est dictum pharetra. Proin quis imperdiet justo, vitae rhoncus velit. <br> Maecenas quis magna tincidunt nulla varius faucibus.
			<button type="button" class="toggleBtn btn btn-xs cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-zinc-700 px-1 py-[0.5] text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-50 hover:opacity-100 relative -top-[2px] ml-1.5 opacity-80">
				<Plus class="w-4 h-4"/>
			</button>
			<span class="hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 text-info">
				Etiam porttitor lectus sed bibendum porta. Nam lobortis non felis a tincidunt. Nullam facilisis quis tellus vitae fermentum.
			</span>
			Ut pellentesque tellus turpis, et vehicula velit scelerisque nec. Nam varius nunc sit amet libero sollicitudin, ac placerat lectus iaculis. 
			<button type="button" class="toggleBtn btn btn-xs cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-zinc-700 px-1 py-[0.5] text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-50 hover:opacity-100 relative -top-[2px] ml-1.5 opacity-80">
				<Plus class="w-4 h-4"/>
			</button>
			<span class="hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 text-info">
				Phasellus nulla mi, pellentesque nec lobortis at, ornare eget velit. Etiam porta tortor risus, quis mattis metus semper nec.
			</span>
			Praesent eu ante sit amet purus sollicitudin dignissim id nec elit. Vestibulum interdum elit a odio volutpat, id cursus nulla laoreet. Etiam massa nunc, venenatis sed tristique eget, tincidunt vel odio.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>